      "text": "# Termux FFmpeg Medya İşleme Aracı (`termux-file-editor`) — Teknik Dokümantasyon\n\nAndroid üzerinde emülasyon katmanı olmadan doğrudan yerel **ARM64 (`aarch64`)** işlemci gücüyle çalışan; paylaşım menüsü (**Paylaş $\\rightarrow$ Termux $\\rightarrow$ Edit**) üzerinden tetiklenen, 10 modlu, kayıpsız kesim, akıllı keyframe tarama, gerçek 2-Pass sıkıştırma ve 8-bit/10-bit H.264/H.265 dönüştürme betiğidir.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Kurulum ve Ön Hazırlık\n\n1. **Termux Kurulumu:** Play Store yerine **GitHub Releases (`termux/termux-app` — `arm64-v8a`)** veya **F-Droid** sürümü kurulmalıdır.\n2. **Paketler ve Depolama İzni:**\n   ```bash\n   pkg update \u0026\u0026 pkg upgrade -y \u0026\u0026 pkg install ffmpeg gawk -y\n   termux-setup-storage\n   ```\n3. **Pil Kısıtlaması:** Uzun 4K/2-Pass işlemlerde sistemin arka planda işlemci hızını kısmaması veya süreci sonlandırmaması için **Ayarlar $\\rightarrow$ Uygulamalar $\\rightarrow$ Termux $\\rightarrow$ Pil Tasarrufu $\\rightarrow$ Kısıtlama yok** seçilmelidir.\n4. **Çıktı Klasörü:** İşlenen tüm medya dosyaları otomatik olarak `/sdcard/Movies/TermuxVideo` klasörüne kaydedilir.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Menü Seçenekleri (1–10)\n\n| No | Seçenek Adı | İşlev ve Teknik Davranış | Çıktı Dosya Adı |\n| :---: | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **1** | **Discord (`\u003c 20 MB \\| 2-Pass`)** | Dosyayı kesinlikle 20 MB sınırının altında kalacak şekilde gerçek **2-Pass ABR** ile sıkıştırır. | `*_H264_20MB.mp4` |\n| **2** | **WhatsApp (`\u003c 100 MB \\| 2-Pass`)** | WhatsApp\u0027ın 100 MB önizlemeli sohbet sınırının hemen altına gerçek **2-Pass ABR** ile sıkıştırır. | `*_H264_100MB.mp4` |\n| **3** | **Ozel Boyut (`MB Gir \\| 2-Pass`)** | Kullanıcının girdiği herhangi bir MB hedefine (ör. `1`, `8`, `25`) 2-Pass ABR uygular. 3 MB ve altı hedeflerde varsayılan sesi otomatik `64k` önerir. | `*_\u003cMB\u003eMB.mp4` |\n| **4** | **Videoyu Kes (`Zaman Sec`)** | Girilen başlangıç/bitiş civarındaki gerçek keyframe\u0027leri tarar; varsayılan olarak **`*Onceki` $\\rightarrow$ `*Sonraki`** keyframe aralığından 4 farklı modda kesim yapar. | `*_Kesit*.mp4` |\n| **5** | **Sadece Format Degistir (`-c copy`)** | Görüntü ve sese dokunmadan (%100 kayıpsız) MP4 kabını yeniler, başlığı (`moov`) dosya başına alır (`+faststart`). | `*_Remux.mp4` |\n| **6** | **Sadece Ses Degistir (`Goruntu copy\\|AAC`)** | Görüntüyü %100 kayıpsız kopyalar (`-c:v copy`), yalnızca uyumsuz sesi (Opus, DTS, EAC3 vb.) seçilen bitrate\u0027te **AAC**\u0027ye çevirir. | `*_AAC_\u003ck\u003ek.mp4` |\n| **7** | **Sadece Goruntu Degistir (`CRF16/20\\|Ses copy`)** | Görüntüyü `H.264 (CRF 16)` veya `H.265 (CRF 20)` olarak yüksek kalitede kodlar; ses izini %100 kayıpsız kopyalar (`-c:a copy`). | `*_H264_CRF16.mp4` |\n| **8** | **Goruntu + Ses Degistir (`CRF16/20 + AAC`)** | Hem görüntüyü (`CRF 16/20`, 8/10-bit, Preset) hem sesi (seçilen bitrate\u0027te AAC) birlikte dönüştürür. | `*_CRF16_AAC_\u003ck\u003ek.mp4` |\n| **9** | **Sesi Ayir (`Orijinal / AAC / MP3`)** | Videodan yalnızca sesi ayırır. Kaynak kodeğe göre her seçeneğin yanında dinamik **`Kayipsiz`** / **`Kayipli`** durumunu gösterir; kaynak zaten AAC/MP3 ise yeniden kodlamadan kopyalar. | `*_Orijinal.\u003cext\u003e` / `*_Ses*.m4a\\|mp3` |\n| **10** | **Ozel FFmpeg Komutu (`Tam Komut`)** | Girdi veya çıktıya müdahale etmeden doğrudan yapıştırılan tam `ffmpeg ...` komutlarını (çoklu `\u0026\u0026` komutları dahil) geçici dizinde çalıştırır, oluşan çıktıyı otomatik `Movies/TermuxVideo`\u0027ya taşır. | Komutta belirtilen ad |\n\n### 4. Seçenek (`Videoyu Kes`) Alt Modları\n1. **Tam Kayipsiz (`Goruntu + Ses copy`):** `-noaccurate_seek` + `-c copy` + `-avoid_negative_ts make_zero`.\n2. **Goruntu Kayipsiz + Ses AAC:** `-noaccurate_seek` + `-c:v copy` + `-c:a aac` (5.1/DTS/EAC3 filmleri TriMP4/mobil uyumlu kesmek için ideal).\n3. **Goruntu Degistir (`CRF`) + Ses copy:** Hassas kesim (`accurate seek`), kodek/bit/FPS/çözünürlük/preset seçimi, ses kayıpsız.\n4. **Goruntu + Ses Degistir (`CRF + AAC`):** Hassas kesim, tam video + ses yeniden kodlama.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Teknik İnce Ayarlar ve Mimari Detaylar\n\n### 3.1. Gerçek 2-Pass Hedef Boyut Hesabı\n* **Formül:**\n  $$\\text{Video Bitrate (kbps)} \u003d \\left\\lfloor \\frac{\\text{Hedef MB} \\times 8000 \\times 0.96}{\\text{Süre (sn)}} - \\text{Ses Bitrate (kbps)} \\right\\rfloor$$\n* `8000 * 0.96` katsayısı, hem `1000`-tabanlı (Android/WhatsApp) hem `1024`-tabanlı (MiB/Discord) sınırların altında kalmak ve MP4 kapsayıcı başlık payını (*muxing overhead*) karşılamak için tek seferlik %4 güvenlik payı uygular.\n* `libx264` için `-pass 1 / -pass 2 -passlogfile` kullanılır; `libx265` ise `-pass` bayrağını desteklemediğinden `-x265-params \"log-level\u003dwarning:pass\u003d1|2:stats\u003d...\"` ile çalıştırılır.\n* Tüm 2-pass log (`.log`, `.cutree`, `.mbtree`) dosyaları `mktemp -d` ile açılan geçici klasörde tutulur ve çıkışta silinir.\n\n### 3.2. Kodek, CRF Eşdeğerliği ve 8-Bit / 10-Bit Yönetimi\n* **Görsel Kalite Eşleştirmesi:** `libx264` için **`CRF 16`**, `libx265` için buna denk arşiv kalitesi olan **`CRF 20`** kullanılır. Tüm `libx265` çıktıları Apple/Android/TriMP4 tam uyumluluğu için **`-tag:v hvc1`** ile etiketlenir.\n* **Dinamik 10-Bit Denetimi:** Betik, açılışta `ffprobe` ile girdi bit derinliğini (`8b`, `10b`, `12b`) üst bilgi satırında gösterir. Dönüştürme sırasında `ffmpeg -h encoder\u003d...` üzerinden `yuv420p10le` desteğini anlık kontrol eder:\n  * **H.265:** Kaynak `10bit`/`12bit` ise varsayılan olarak **`Enter \u003d 10bit (Koru)`**, kaynak `8bit` ise **`Enter \u003d 8bit`** önerir.\n  * **H.264:** Mobil donanım çözücüler, TriMP4, WhatsApp ve Discord H.264 10-bit (`High 10`) açmadığı için varsayılan daima **`Enter \u003d 8bit (Uyumlu)`** tutulur; `libx264` derlemesi destekliyorsa `10` seçeneği `(Sadece VLC)` uyarısıyla sunulur.\n* **Preset Seçenekleri:** `1\u003dfast`, `2\u003dmedium`, `3\u003dslow`, `4\u003dveryslow` (ek olarak elle yazılırsa `slower`). 2-Pass modlarında varsayılan `medium`, CRF modlarında `fast`\u0027tir.\n* **Ses Bitrate Aralığı:** `32k` – `768k` desteklenir (5.1 surround filmler için `320k`/`384k`+ dahil). Kullanıcı `192k` veya `192` yazsa da `k`/`K` otomatik normalize edilir.\n\n### 3.3. Akıllı Çözünürlük ve En-Boy Oranı Ölçekleme\n* Desteklenen hedefler: **`2160p`**, **`1440p`**, **`1080p`**, **`720p`**, **`480p`** (sondaki `p`/`P` otomatik temizlenir; boş bırakılırsa `Enter \u003d Orijinal`).\n* **3 Yönlü Oran Koruması:**\n  1. **Dikey videolar (`HEIGHT \u003e WIDTH`, ör. 9:16 Reels, 4:5 Instagram):** `scale\u003d\u003chedef\u003e:-2`\n  2. **Geniş sinema filmleri (`WIDTH * 9 \u003e HEIGHT * 16`, ör. `3840x1600` 2.39:1):** Uzun kenarı `3840/2560/1920/1280/854` sınırına oturtarak `scale\u003d\u003cL_MAX\u003e:-2` (ör. `1920x800`, genişliğin `2592`\u0027ye taşmasını önler).\n  3. **Standart `16:9` / `4:3` / `1:1`:** `scale\u003d-2:\u003chedef\u003e`\n* **Tek Piksel Koruması (`EVEN_VF`):** Orijinal çözünürlük korunurken kaynak en/boyu tek sayıysa (`1079x1920` gibi ekran kayıtları) `yuv420p` / `yuv420p10le` çökmesini önlemek için otomatik `scale\u003dtrunc(iw/2)*2:trunc(ih/2)*2` devreye girer.\n\n### 3.4. Keyframe Tarayıcı ve Garantili Kayıpsız Kesim\n* `show_kf_at()`, videoyu çözmeden (`-show_packets`, `-read_intervals \"${seek_s}%+28\"`) yalnızca girilen zamanların ±12 sn çevresindeki paket başlıklarını milisaniyeler içinde tarar (`pts_time`, yoksa `dts_time`).\n* Başlangıçta **`*Onceki`**, bitişte **`*Sonraki`** keyframe işaretlenir.\n  * **`Enter`** basıldığında başlangıç **`prev_kf + 0.005`** (1 mikrosaniyelik yuvarlama sapmasıyla önceki GOP\u0027a sıçramayı engelleyen 5 ms tampon) ve bitiş **`next_kf`** ham PTS değerine kilitlenir.\n  * **`k`** kullanıcının yazdığı ham süreleri korur; **`r`** zamanları tekrar girmeye döner.\n* Bitiş $\\le$ Başlangıç girilmesi engellenir; ilerleme yüzdesi (`%`) tüm film yerine yalnızca kesilecek parçanın süresine (`CLIP_DUR`) göre hesaplanır.\n\n### 3.5. Canlı İlerleme, Bellek/Depolama Hijyeni ve Akış Koruması\n* **Temiz İlerleme Satırı (`run_ff`):** `-nostdin -hide_banner -loglevel warning -nostats -progress pipe:1` ile FFmpeg\u0027in satır taşıran `elapsed\u003d` çıktısı yerine tek satırda `Sure: 24.6 / 61.4 sn (%40) | 1.34x | 4820kb` (tam sayı KB, noktalı MB\u0027ye dönmeden) gösterilir. Çıkış kodu `${PIPESTATUS[0]}` ile gerçek FFmpeg durumundan alınır.\n* **Akış Koruması:** Tüm video/ses işlemlerinde `-sn -dn` ile MP4 muxer\u0027ını bozan altyazı/veri akışları elenir; `-movflags +faststart` ile hızlı açılış ve TriMP4 uyumluluğu sağlanır.\n* **Sıfır Şişme (Çöp Temizliği):**\n  * Başlangıçta `$HOME/downloads/` içindeki eski yetim paylaşım kopyaları (mevcut `$INPUT` hariç) temizlenir.\n  * `trap cleanup EXIT INT TERM` ile normal çıkışta, `Ctrl+C` kesintisinde veya hata durumunda: `$PASSDIR` silinir, işlem başarısızsa yarıda kalmış bozuk `$OUTFILE` silinir, `$INPUT` yalnızca `$HOME/downloads/` içindeyse silinir (diskteki orijinal dosyalara asla dokunulmaz) ve `termux-wake-unlock` çağrılır.\n  * `export LC_ALL\u003dC` ile ondalık virgül/nokta uyumsuzlukları tamamen önlenir.\n\n### 3.6. Galeri ve \"Son Dosyalar\" Görünürlüğü (MediaStore)\nTermux Linux API üzerinden yazdığı için Android MediaStore veritabanını anında güncellemek amacıyla iki yöntem desteklenir:\n* **MacroDroid + Shizuku (%0 Ekstra Şarj):**\n  * *Tetikleyici:* `Bildirim -\u003e Bildirim Temizlendi` $\\rightarrow$ Uygulama: **Termux** $\\rightarrow$ Metin: **Herhangi Biri** *(**\"Devam eden/kalıcı bildirimleri yoksay\"** tiki **kaldırılmalı**)*.\n  * *Eylem:* `Kabuk Betiği` (**Shizuku** modu) $\\rightarrow$\n    ```sh\n    content call --method scan_volume --uri content://media --arg external_primary\n    ```\n* **Termux:API (Alternatif):** Ana Termux ile aynı kaynaktan `Termux:API` APK\u0027sı + `pkg install termux-api -y` kurulursa betik sonundaki `timeout 5 termux-media-scan \"$OUTFILE\"` satırı dosyayı otomatik tarar.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Betiğin En Son Çalışan Tam Kodu (`~/bin/termux-file-editor`)\n\nAşağıdaki bloğun tamamı Termux\u0027a tek seferde yapıştırılıp **Enter**\u0027a basıldığında betik kurulur, çalıştırılabilir yapılır ve `bash -n` ile sözdizimi doğrulanır:\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p ~/bin\ncat \u003c\u003c \u0027EOF\u0027 \u003e ~/bin/termux-file-editor\n#!/data/data/com.termux/files/usr/bin/bash\nexport LC_ALL\u003dC\n\nINPUT\u003d\"$1\"\nif [ -z \"$INPUT\" ] || [ ! -f \"$INPUT\" ]; then\n  echo \"Hata: Dosya bulunamadi!\"\n  read -p \"Cikmak icin Enter\u0027a basin...\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n\nPASSDIR\u003d\"\"\nOUTFILE\u003d\"\"\nSTATUS\u003d1\nfor old in \"$HOME/downloads/\"*; do\n  [ -e \"$old\" ] \u0026\u0026 [ \"$old\" !\u003d \"$INPUT\" ] \u0026\u0026 rm -rf \"$old\"\ndone\ncleanup() {\n  trap - EXIT INT TERM\n  [ -n \"$PASSDIR\" ] \u0026\u0026 [ -d \"$PASSDIR\" ] \u0026\u0026 rm -rf \"$PASSDIR\"\n  [ \"$STATUS\" -ne 0 ] \u0026\u0026 [ -n \"$OUTFILE\" ] \u0026\u0026 [ -f \"$OUTFILE\" ] \u0026\u0026 [ \"$OUTFILE\" !\u003d \"$INPUT\" ] \u0026\u0026 rm -f \"$OUTFILE\"\n  case \"$INPUT\" in\n    \"$HOME/downloads/\"*) rm -f \"$INPUT\" ;;\n  esac\n  command -v termux-wake-unlock \u003e/dev/null \u0026\u0026 termux-wake-unlock\n}\ncommand -v termux-wake-lock \u003e/dev/null \u0026\u0026 termux-wake-lock\ntrap cleanup EXIT INT TERM\n\nOUTDIR\u003d\"/sdcard/Movies/TermuxVideo\"\nmkdir -p \"$OUTDIR\"\n\nFILENAME\u003d\"$(basename -- \"$INPUT\")\"\nBASENAME\u003d\"${FILENAME%.*}\"\n\nBYTES\u003d$(wc -c \u003c \"$INPUT\" 2\u003e/dev/null || echo 0)\nSIZE_MB\u003d$(awk -v b\u003d\"$BYTES\" \u0027BEGIN { if (b+0 \u003e 0) printf \"%.1fmb\", b / 1048576; else print \"?\" }\u0027)\n\nDURATION\u003d$(ffprobe -v error -show_entries format\u003dduration -of default\u003dnoprint_wrappers\u003d1:nokey\u003d1 \"$INPUT\" | head -n 1)\nVCODEC\u003d$(ffprobe -v error -select_streams v:0 -show_entries stream\u003dcodec_name -of default\u003dnoprint_wrappers\u003d1:nokey\u003d1 \"$INPUT\" | head -n 1)\nWIDTH\u003d$(ffprobe -v error -select_streams v:0 -show_entries stream\u003dwidth -of default\u003dnoprint_wrappers\u003d1:nokey\u003d1 \"$INPUT\" | head -n 1)\nHEIGHT\u003d$(ffprobe -v error -select_streams v:0 -show_entries stream\u003dheight -of default\u003dnoprint_wrappers\u003d1:nokey\u003d1 \"$INPUT\" | head -n 1)\nPIX_FMT\u003d$(ffprobe -v error -select_streams v:0 -show_entries stream\u003dpix_fmt -of default\u003dnoprint_wrappers\u003d1:nokey\u003d1 \"$INPUT\" | head -n 1)\nACODEC\u003d$(ffprobe -v error -select_streams a:0 -show_entries stream\u003dcodec_name -of default\u003dnoprint_wrappers\u003d1:nokey\u003d1 \"$INPUT\" | head -n 1)\n\nBIT_IN\u003d\"8bit\"\nBIT_SHORT\u003d\"\"\nif [[ \"$PIX_FMT\" \u003d\u003d *10* ]]; then\n  BIT_IN\u003d\"10bit\"; BIT_SHORT\u003d\" 10b\"\nelif [[ \"$PIX_FMT\" \u003d\u003d *12* ]]; then\n  BIT_IN\u003d\"12bit\"; BIT_SHORT\u003d\" 12b\"\nelif [ -n \"$PIX_FMT\" ]; then\n  BIT_IN\u003d\"8bit\"; BIT_SHORT\u003d\" 8b\"\nfi\n\nupdate_dur_vars() {\n  local d\u003d\"${1:-$DURATION}\"\n  DUR_SHOW\u003d$(awk -v d\u003d\"$d\" \u0027BEGIN { if (d+0 \u003e 0) printf \"%.1f\", d; else print \"?\" }\u0027)\n  DUR_TENTHS\u003d$(awk -v d\u003d\"$d\" \u0027BEGIN { t \u003d int(d * 10); if (t \u003c 0) t \u003d 0; print t }\u0027)\n}\nupdate_dur_vars \"$DURATION\"\n\nEVEN_VF\u003d\"\"\nif [[ \"$WIDTH\" \u003d~ ^[0-9]+$ ]] \u0026\u0026 [[ \"$HEIGHT\" \u003d~ ^[0-9]+$ ]]; then\n  if [ $((WIDTH % 2)) -ne 0 ] || [ $((HEIGHT % 2)) -ne 0 ]; then\n    EVEN_VF\u003d\"-vf scale\u003dtrunc(iw/2)*2:trunc(ih/2)*2\"\n  fi\nfi\n\nclear\necho \"\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\"\necho \"  Dosya : $FILENAME\"\necho \"  Video : ${VCODEC:-?}${BIT_SHORT} | ${WIDTH:-?}x${HEIGHT:-?} | ${DUR_SHOW} sn | ${SIZE_MB}\"\necho \"  Ses   : ${ACODEC:-Yok}\"\necho \"\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\"\necho \"  1) Discord (\u003c 20 MB | 2-Pass)\"\necho \"  2) WhatsApp (\u003c 100 MB | 2-Pass)\"\necho \"  3) Ozel Boyut (MB Gir | 2-Pass)\"\necho \"  4) Videoyu Kes (Zaman Sec)\"\necho \"  5) Sadece Format Degistir (-c copy)\"\necho \"  6) Sadece Ses Degistir (Goruntu copy|AAC)\"\necho \"  7) Sadece Goruntu Degistir (CRF16/20|Ses copy)\"\necho \"  8) Goruntu + Ses Degistir (CRF16/20 + AAC)\"\necho \"  9) Sesi Ayir (Orijinal / AAC / MP3)\"\necho \" 10) Ozel FFmpeg Komutu (Tam Komut)\"\necho \"\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\"\nread -p \"Seciminiz [1-10]: \" CHOICE\n\nrun_ff() {\n  local cur_t\u003d0 sec\u003d0 dec\u003d0 pct\u003d0 kb\u003d0 spd\u003d\"...\" sz\u003d\"\"\n  ffmpeg -nostdin -hide_banner -loglevel warning -nostats -progress pipe:1 \"$@\" | \\\n  while IFS\u003d\u0027\u003d\u0027 read -r k v; do\n    case \"$k\" in\n      out_time_us)\n        if [[ \"$v\" \u003d~ ^[0-9]+$ ]]; then\n          cur_t\u003d$((v / 100000))\n          sec\u003d$((cur_t / 10))\n          dec\u003d$((cur_t % 10))\n        fi\n        ;;\n      total_size)\n        if [[ \"$v\" \u003d~ ^[0-9]+$ ]]; then\n          kb\u003d$((v / 1024))\n        fi\n        ;;\n      speed)\n        spd\u003d\"${v// /}\"\n        ;;\n      progress)\n        if [ \"$kb\" -gt 0 ] 2\u003e/dev/null; then\n          sz\u003d\" | ${kb}kb\"\n        else\n          sz\u003d\"\"\n        fi\n        if [ \"$DUR_TENTHS\" -gt 0 ] 2\u003e/dev/null; then\n          pct\u003d$((cur_t * 100 / DUR_TENTHS))\n          [ \"$pct\" -gt 100 ] \u0026\u0026 pct\u003d100\n          printf \"\\r  Sure: %d.%d / %s sn (%%%d) | %s%s   \" \"$sec\" \"$dec\" \"$DUR_SHOW\" \"$pct\" \"$spd\" \"$sz\"\n        else\n          printf \"\\r  Sure: %d.%d sn | %s%s   \" \"$sec\" \"$dec\" \"$spd\" \"$sz\"\n        fi\n        ;;\n    esac\n  done\n  local rc\u003d\"${PIPESTATUS[0]}\"\n  echo \"\"\n  return \"$rc\"\n}\n\nask_vcodec() {\n  read -p \"Kodek [Enter\u003dH.264, 2\u003dH.265 (HEVC)]: \" C_OPT\n  case \"$C_OPT\" in\n    2|265|h265|H265|hevc|HEVC)\n      VCODEC_OUT\u003d\"libx265\"\n      CRF_VAL\u003d\"20\"\n      CODEC_TAG\u003d\"H265\"\n      ;;\n    *)\n      VCODEC_OUT\u003d\"libx264\"\n      CRF_VAL\u003d\"16\"\n      CODEC_TAG\u003d\"H264\"\n      ;;\n  esac\n\n  PIX_OUT\u003d\"yuv420p\"\n  BIT_TAG\u003d\"\"\n  if ffmpeg -hide_banner -h \"encoder\u003d${VCODEC_OUT}\" 2\u003e/dev/null | grep -q \"yuv420p10le\"; then\n    if [ \"$VCODEC_OUT\" \u003d \"libx265\" ]; then\n      if [ \"$BIT_IN\" \u003d \"10bit\" ] || [ \"$BIT_IN\" \u003d \"12bit\" ]; then\n        read -p \"Renk Bit [Enter\u003d10bit (Koru), 8\u003d8bit]: \" B_OPT\n        case \"$B_OPT\" in\n          8|1) PIX_OUT\u003d\"yuv420p\" ;;\n          *) PIX_OUT\u003d\"yuv420p10le\"; BIT_TAG\u003d\"_10bit\" ;;\n        esac\n      else\n        read -p \"Renk Bit [Enter\u003d8bit, 10\u003d10bit]: \" B_OPT\n        case \"$B_OPT\" in\n          10|2) PIX_OUT\u003d\"yuv420p10le\"; BIT_TAG\u003d\"_10bit\" ;;\n          *) PIX_OUT\u003d\"yuv420p\" ;;\n        esac\n      fi\n    else\n      read -p \"H.264 Bit [Enter\u003d8bit (Uyumlu), 10\u003d10bit (Sadece VLC)]: \" B_OPT\n      case \"$B_OPT\" in\n        10|2) PIX_OUT\u003d\"yuv420p10le\"; BIT_TAG\u003d\"_10bit\" ;;\n        *) PIX_OUT\u003d\"yuv420p\" ;;\n      esac\n    fi\n  fi\n}\n\nask_fps_and_scale() {\n  local def_fps\u003d\"${1:-30}\"\n  if [ \"$def_fps\" \u003d \"orig\" ]; then\n    read -p \"FPS [Enter\u003dOrijinal FPS, 1\u003d30 FPS]: \" FPS_OPT\n    if [ \"$FPS_OPT\" \u003d \"1\" ] || [ \"$FPS_OPT\" \u003d \"30\" ]; then\n      FPS_ARG\u003d\"-r 30\"\n    else\n      FPS_ARG\u003d\"\"\n    fi\n  else\n    read -p \"FPS [Enter\u003d30 FPS, 2\u003dOrijinal FPS]: \" FPS_OPT\n    if [ \"$FPS_OPT\" \u003d \"2\" ]; then\n      FPS_ARG\u003d\"\"\n    else\n      FPS_ARG\u003d\"-r 30\"\n    fi\n  fi\n\n  echo \"  Cozunurluklar: 2160p | 1440p | 1080p | 720p | 480p\"\n  read -p \"Cozunurluk [Enter\u003dOrijinal]: \" RES_OPT\n  RES_OPT\u003d\"${RES_OPT// /}\"\n  RES_OPT\u003d\"${RES_OPT%p}\"\n  RES_OPT\u003d\"${RES_OPT%P}\"\n  VF_ARG\u003d\"$EVEN_VF\"\n  case \"$RES_OPT\" in\n    2160|1440|1080|720|480)\n      case \"$RES_OPT\" in\n        2160) L_MAX\u003d3840 ;;\n        1440) L_MAX\u003d2560 ;;\n        1080) L_MAX\u003d1920 ;;\n        720)  L_MAX\u003d1280 ;;\n        480)  L_MAX\u003d854 ;;\n      esac\n      if [[ \"$WIDTH\" \u003d~ ^[0-9]+$ ]] \u0026\u0026 [[ \"$HEIGHT\" \u003d~ ^[0-9]+$ ]]; then\n        if [ \"$HEIGHT\" -gt \"$WIDTH\" ]; then\n          VF_ARG\u003d\"-vf scale\u003d${RES_OPT}:-2\"\n        elif [ $((WIDTH * 9)) -gt $((HEIGHT * 16)) ]; then\n          VF_ARG\u003d\"-vf scale\u003d${L_MAX}:-2\"\n        else\n          VF_ARG\u003d\"-vf scale\u003d-2:${RES_OPT}\"\n        fi\n      else\n        VF_ARG\u003d\"-vf scale\u003d-2:${RES_OPT}\"\n      fi\n      ;;\n  esac\n}\n\nask_preset() {\n  DEF_P\u003d\"${1:-medium}\"\n  if [ \"$DEF_P\" \u003d \"fast\" ]; then\n    read -p \"Preset [Enter\u003dfast,2\u003dmed,3\u003dslow,4\u003dvslow]: \" P_OPT\n  else\n    read -p \"Preset [1\u003dfast,Enter\u003dmed,3\u003dslow,4\u003dvslow]: \" P_OPT\n  fi\n  case \"$P_OPT\" in\n    \"\") PRESET\u003d\"$DEF_P\" ;;\n    1|f|F|fast|FAST) PRESET\u003d\"fast\" ;;\n    2|m|M|medium|MEDIUM) PRESET\u003d\"medium\" ;;\n    3|s|S|slow|SLOW) PRESET\u003d\"slow\" ;;\n    slower|SLOWER) PRESET\u003d\"slower\" ;;\n    4|v|V|vs|vslow|veryslow|VERYSLOW) PRESET\u003d\"veryslow\" ;;\n    *) echo \"Gecersiz secim, varsayilan ($DEF_P) secildi.\"; PRESET\u003d\"$DEF_P\" ;;\n  esac\n}\n\nask_audio_bitrate() {\n  local def_ab\u003d\"${1:-256}\"\n  read -p \"Ses (Kayipli) [Enter\u003d${def_ab}k, 64..768]: \" AB_OPT\n  AB_OPT\u003d\"${AB_OPT//k/}\"\n  AB_OPT\u003d\"${AB_OPT//K/}\"\n  if [ -z \"$AB_OPT\" ]; then\n    AB_VAL\u003d\"$def_ab\"\n  elif [[ \"$AB_OPT\" \u003d~ ^[0-9]+$ ]] \u0026\u0026 [ \"$AB_OPT\" -ge 32 ] \u0026\u0026 [ \"$AB_OPT\" -le 768 ]; then\n    AB_VAL\u003d\"$AB_OPT\"\n  else\n    echo \"Gecersiz deger, varsayilan ${def_ab}k kullaniliyor.\"\n    AB_VAL\u003d\"$def_ab\"\n  fi\n}\n\nrun_two_pass() {\n  TARGET_MB\u003d\"$1\"\n  if [ -z \"$DURATION\" ] || [ \"$DURATION\" \u003d \"N/A\" ]; then\n    read -p \"Sure okunamadi, saniye olarak girin: \" DURATION\n  fi\n  DURATION\u003d\"${DURATION/,/.}\"\n  update_dur_vars \"$DURATION\"\n\n  ask_vcodec\n  ask_fps_and_scale 30\n  ask_preset medium\n\n  if [ -z \"$ACODEC\" ]; then\n    ABPS\u003d0\n    AUDIO_ARGS\u003d\"-an\"\n  else\n    if [ \"$(awk -v m\u003d\"$TARGET_MB\" \u0027BEGIN { print (m \u003c\u003d 3) }\u0027)\" \u003d \"1\" ]; then\n      ask_audio_bitrate 64\n    else\n      ask_audio_bitrate 128\n    fi\n    ABPS\u003d\"$AB_VAL\"\n    AUDIO_ARGS\u003d\"-c:a aac -b:a ${ABPS}k\"\n  fi\n\n  VKBPS\u003d$(awk -v mb\u003d\"$TARGET_MB\" -v dur\u003d\"$DURATION\" -v ab\u003d\"$ABPS\" \u0027BEGIN {\n    if (dur \u003c\u003d 0) dur \u003d 1;\n    total_kb \u003d mb * 8000 * 0.96;\n    v \u003d int((total_kb / dur) - ab);\n    if (v \u003c 80) v \u003d 80;\n    print v;\n  }\u0027)\n\n  PASSDIR\u003d$(mktemp -d)\n  PASSLOG\u003d\"$PASSDIR/ff2pass\"\n  OUTFILE\u003d\"$OUTDIR/${BASENAME}_${CODEC_TAG}${BIT_TAG}_${TARGET_MB}MB.mp4\"\n\n  if [ \"$VCODEC_OUT\" \u003d \"libx265\" ]; then\n    PASS1_ARGS\u003d(-x265-params \"log-level\u003dwarning:pass\u003d1:stats\u003d${PASSLOG}.log\")\n    PASS2_ARGS\u003d(-tag:v hvc1 -x265-params \"log-level\u003dwarning:pass\u003d2:stats\u003d${PASSLOG}.log\")\n  else\n    PASS1_ARGS\u003d(-pass 1 -passlogfile \"$PASSLOG\")\n    PASS2_ARGS\u003d(-pass 2 -passlogfile \"$PASSLOG\")\n  fi\n\n  echo \"\"\n  echo \"Hedef: \u003c ${TARGET_MB} MB | ${CODEC_TAG}${BIT_TAG} ${VKBPS}k | Ses: ${ABPS}k | ${PRESET}\"\n  if [ \"$VKBPS\" -le 120 ] 2\u003e/dev/null; then\n    echo \"Not: Hedef/ses oranina gore video bitrati cok dusuk, boyut asabilir.\"\n  fi\n  echo \"--- 1/2 Gecis (Analiz ediliyor)... ---\"\n  if run_ff -y -i \"$INPUT\" $FPS_ARG $VF_ARG -sn -dn -c:v \"$VCODEC_OUT\" -preset \"$PRESET\" -b:v \"${VKBPS}k\" -pix_fmt \"$PIX_OUT\" \"${PASS1_ARGS[@]}\" -an -f null /dev/null; then\n    echo \"--- 2/2 Gecis (Kodlaniyor)... ---\"\n    run_ff -y -i \"$INPUT\" $FPS_ARG $VF_ARG -sn -dn -c:v \"$VCODEC_OUT\" -preset \"$PRESET\" -b:v \"${VKBPS}k\" -pix_fmt \"$PIX_OUT\" \"${PASS2_ARGS[@]}\" $AUDIO_ARGS -movflags +faststart \"$OUTFILE\"\n    STATUS\u003d$?\n  else\n    STATUS\u003d1\n  fi\n}\n\nshow_kf_at() {\n  local mode\u003d\"$1\" label\u003d\"$2\" raw_t\u003d\"$3\" kfile\u003d\"$4\"\n  local target_s seek_s\n  target_s\u003d$(awk -v v\u003d\"$raw_t\" \u0027BEGIN {\n    n \u003d split(v, a, \":\");\n    if (n \u003d\u003d 1) printf \"%.3f\", a[1] + 0;\n    else if (n \u003d\u003d 2) printf \"%.3f\", a[1]*60 + a[2];\n    else if (n \u003d\u003d 3) printf \"%.3f\", a[1]*3600 + a[2]*60 + a[3];\n    else print -1;\n  }\u0027)\n  if [ \"$(awk -v t\u003d\"$target_s\" \u0027BEGIN { print (t \u003e\u003d 0) }\u0027)\" !\u003d \"1\" ]; then\n    return\n  fi\n  seek_s\u003d$(awk -v t\u003d\"$target_s\" \u0027BEGIN { s \u003d int(t) - 15; if (s \u003c 0) s \u003d 0; print s }\u0027)\n  ffprobe -v error -select_streams v:0 -read_intervals \"${seek_s}%+28\" -show_packets -show_entries packet\u003dpts_time,dts_time,flags -of compact\u003dp\u003d0 \"$INPUT\" 2\u003e/dev/null | \\\n  awk -F\u0027|\u0027 -v tgt\u003d\"$target_s\" -v lbl\u003d\"$label\" -v raw\u003d\"$raw_t\" -v md\u003d\"$mode\" -v kf\u003d\"$kfile\" \u0027\n    function fmt(x,   t10, h, m, s10) {\n      if (x \u003c 0) return \"Yok\";\n      t10 \u003d int(x * 10 + 0.5);\n      h \u003d int(t10 / 36000);\n      m \u003d int((t10 % 36000) / 600);\n      s10 \u003d t10 % 600;\n      if (h \u003e 0) return sprintf(\"%d:%02d:%02d.%d\", h, m, int(s10 / 10), s10 % 10);\n      return sprintf(\"%02d:%02d.%d\", m, int(s10 / 10), s10 % 10);\n    }\n    BEGIN { prev_kf \u003d -1; next_kf \u003d -1; near \u003d \"\"; }\n    /flags\u003dK/ {\n      t\u003d\"\"; d\u003d\"\"\n      for (i\u003d1; i\u003c\u003dNF; i++) {\n        if ($i ~ /^pts_time\u003d/) { sub(/^pts_time\u003d/, \"\", $i); t\u003d$i }\n        else if ($i ~ /^dts_time\u003d/) { sub(/^dts_time\u003d/, \"\", $i); d\u003d$i }\n      }\n      if (t \u003d\u003d \"N/A\" || t \u003d\u003d \"\") t \u003d d\n      if (t !\u003d \"N/A\" \u0026\u0026 t !\u003d \"\") {\n        val \u003d t + 0;\n        if (val \u003c\u003d tgt + 0.05) prev_kf \u003d val;\n        if (next_kf \u003c 0 \u0026\u0026 val \u003e\u003d tgt - 0.05) next_kf \u003d val;\n        if (val \u003e\u003d tgt - 12 \u0026\u0026 val \u003c\u003d tgt + 10) {\n          f \u003d fmt(val);\n          if (f !\u003d last_f) {\n            near \u003d (near \u003d\u003d \"\" ? f : near \" | \" f);\n            last_f \u003d f;\n          }\n        }\n        if (val \u003e tgt + 12) exit;\n      }\n    }\n    END {\n      if (md \u003d\u003d \"start\") {\n        printf \"%s (%s): *Onceki %s | Sonraki %s\\n\", lbl, raw, fmt(prev_kf), fmt(next_kf);\n        if (prev_kf \u003e\u003d 0) printf \"KF_RAW\u003d%.3f\\nKF_FMT\u003d%s\\n\", prev_kf + 0.005, fmt(prev_kf) \u003e kf;\n      } else {\n        printf \"%s (%s): Onceki %s | *Sonraki %s\\n\", lbl, raw, fmt(prev_kf), fmt(next_kf);\n        if (next_kf \u003e\u003d 0) printf \"KF_RAW\u003d%.3f\\nKF_FMT\u003d%s\\n\", next_kf, fmt(next_kf) \u003e kf;\n      }\n      if (near !\u003d \"\") printf \"  Civar: %s\\n\", near;\n    }\u0027\n}\n\nrun_trim() {\n  local kf_tmp KF_START KF_END KF_S_DISP KF_E_DISP\n  while true; do\n    echo \"\"\n    read -p \"Baslangic [Orn 00:01:00 veya 01:30 | Enter\u003dBas]: \" START_T\n    read -p \"Bitis     [Orn 00:02:32 veya 02:32 | Enter\u003dSon]: \" END_T\n    START_T\u003d\"${START_T// /}\"\n    END_T\u003d\"${END_T// /}\"\n    if [ -z \"$START_T\" ] \u0026\u0026 [ -z \"$END_T\" ]; then\n      echo \"Baslangic veya bitis girmediniz!\"\n      read -p \"Cikmak icin Enter...\"\n      exit 1\n    fi\n    if [ -n \"$START_T\" ] \u0026\u0026 [ -n \"$END_T\" ]; then\n      TIME_OK\u003d$(awk -v s\u003d\"$START_T\" -v e\u003d\"$END_T\" \u0027\n      function ts(v,   n, a) {\n        n \u003d split(v, a, \":\");\n        if (n \u003d\u003d 1) return a[1] + 0;\n        if (n \u003d\u003d 2) return a[1]*60 + a[2];\n        if (n \u003d\u003d 3) return a[1]*3600 + a[2]*60 + a[3];\n        return -1;\n      }\n      BEGIN { ss \u003d ts(s); ee \u003d ts(e); print (ss \u003e\u003d 0 \u0026\u0026 ee \u003e ss) ? 1 : 0 }\u0027)\n      if [ \"$TIME_OK\" !\u003d \"1\" ]; then\n        echo \"Hata: Bitis zamani baslangictan buyuk olmali!\"\n        continue\n      fi\n    fi\n\n    KF_START\u003d\"\"; KF_END\u003d\"\"\n    KF_S_DISP\u003d\"${START_T:-00:00}\"; KF_E_DISP\u003d\"${END_T:-Son}\"\n    kf_tmp\u003d$(mktemp)\n    echo \"\"\n    echo \"Keyframe konumlari kontrol ediliyor...\"\n    if [ -n \"$START_T\" ] \u0026\u0026 [ -n \"$VCODEC\" ]; then\n      : \u003e \"$kf_tmp\"\n      show_kf_at \"start\" \"Baslangic\" \"$START_T\" \"$kf_tmp\"\n      KF_RAW\u003d\"\"; KF_FMT\u003d\"\"\n      source \"$kf_tmp\"\n      [ -n \"$KF_RAW\" ] \u0026\u0026 KF_START\u003d\"$KF_RAW\" \u0026\u0026 KF_S_DISP\u003d\"$KF_FMT\"\n    fi\n    if [ -n \"$END_T\" ] \u0026\u0026 [ -n \"$VCODEC\" ]; then\n      : \u003e \"$kf_tmp\"\n      show_kf_at \"end\" \"Bitis    \" \"$END_T\" \"$kf_tmp\"\n      KF_RAW\u003d\"\"; KF_FMT\u003d\"\"\n      source \"$kf_tmp\"\n      [ -n \"$KF_RAW\" ] \u0026\u0026 KF_END\u003d\"$KF_RAW\" \u0026\u0026 KF_E_DISP\u003d\"$KF_FMT\"\n    fi\n    rm -f \"$kf_tmp\"\n\n    echo \"\"\n    read -p \"Enter\u003d*KF\u0027lerden kes | k\u003dYazdigim | r\u003dDegistir: \" RE_OPT\n    case \"$RE_OPT\" in\n      r|R) continue ;;\n      k|K) break ;;\n      *)\n        [ -n \"$KF_START\" ] \u0026\u0026 START_T\u003d\"$KF_START\"\n        [ -n \"$KF_END\" ] \u0026\u0026 END_T\u003d\"$KF_END\"\n        echo \"  Secilen aralik: ${KF_S_DISP} -\u003e ${KF_E_DISP}\"\n        break\n        ;;\n    esac\n  done\n\n  CLIP_DUR\u003d$(awk -v s\u003d\"$START_T\" -v e\u003d\"$END_T\" -v tot\u003d\"$DURATION\" \u0027\n  function ts(v,   n, a) {\n    if (v \u003d\u003d \"\") return -1;\n    n \u003d split(v, a, \":\");\n    if (n \u003d\u003d 1) return a[1] + 0;\n    if (n \u003d\u003d 2) return a[1]*60 + a[2];\n    if (n \u003d\u003d 3) return a[1]*3600 + a[2]*60 + a[3];\n    return -1;\n  }\n  BEGIN {\n    ss \u003d (s \u003d\u003d \"\") ? 0 : ts(s);\n    ee \u003d (e \u003d\u003d \"\") ? (tot + 0) : ts(e);\n    if (ss \u003e\u003d 0 \u0026\u0026 ee \u003e ss) printf \"%.2f\", (ee - ss);\n    else print \"0\";\n  }\u0027)\n  if [ \"$(awk -v c\u003d\"$CLIP_DUR\" \u0027BEGIN { print (c \u003e 0) }\u0027)\" \u003d \"1\" ]; then\n    update_dur_vars \"$CLIP_DUR\"\n  else\n    DUR_TENTHS\u003d0\n  fi\n\n  echo \"\"\n  echo \"  1) Tam Kayipsiz (Goruntu + Ses copy)\"\n  echo \"  2) Goruntu Kayipsiz + Ses AAC\"\n  echo \"  3) Goruntu Degistir (CRF) + Ses copy\"\n  echo \"  4) Goruntu + Ses Degistir (CRF + AAC)\"\n  read -p \"Kesim modu [1-4]: \" TM_OPT\n\n  SEEK_COPY\u003d()\n  SEEK_REENC\u003d()\n  if [ -n \"$START_T\" ]; then\n    SEEK_COPY\u003d(-noaccurate_seek -ss \"$START_T\")\n    SEEK_REENC\u003d(-ss \"$START_T\")\n  fi\n  if [ -n \"$END_T\" ]; then\n    SEEK_COPY+\u003d(-to \"$END_T\")\n    SEEK_REENC+\u003d(-to \"$END_T\")\n  fi\n\n  case \"$TM_OPT\" in\n    1)\n      OUTFILE\u003d\"$OUTDIR/${BASENAME}_Kesit.mp4\"\n      echo \"\"\n      echo \"--- Kayipsiz kesiliyor (-noaccurate_seek)... ---\"\n      run_ff -y \"${SEEK_COPY[@]}\" -i \"$INPUT\" -sn -dn -c copy -avoid_negative_ts make_zero -movflags +faststart \"$OUTFILE\"\n      STATUS\u003d$?\n      if [ \"$STATUS\" -ne 0 ]; then\n        echo \"Ipucu: Ses MP4\u0027e uymuyorsa 2. modu (Ses AAC) secin.\"\n      fi\n      ;;\n    2)\n      if [ -z \"$ACODEC\" ]; then\n        AUDIO_ARGS\u003d\"-an\"\n        OUTFILE\u003d\"$OUTDIR/${BASENAME}_Kesit_Sessiz.mp4\"\n      else\n        ask_audio_bitrate 192\n        AUDIO_ARGS\u003d\"-c:a aac -b:a ${AB_VAL}k\"\n        OUTFILE\u003d\"$OUTDIR/${BASENAME}_Kesit_AAC_${AB_VAL}k.mp4\"\n      fi\n      echo \"\"\n      echo \"--- Goruntu kayipsiz + Ses AAC kesiliyor... ---\"\n      run_ff -y \"${SEEK_COPY[@]}\" -i \"$INPUT\" -sn -dn -c:v copy $AUDIO_ARGS -avoid_negative_ts make_zero -movflags +faststart \"$OUTFILE\"\n      STATUS\u003d$?\n      ;;\n    3)\n      ask_vcodec\n      ask_fps_and_scale orig\n      ask_preset fast\n      if [ \"$VCODEC_OUT\" \u003d \"libx265\" ]; then\n        CRF_ARGS\u003d(-tag:v hvc1 -x265-params \"log-level\u003dwarning\")\n      else\n        CRF_ARGS\u003d()\n      fi\n      if [ -z \"$ACODEC\" ]; then\n        AUDIO_ARGS\u003d\"-an\"\n      else\n        AUDIO_ARGS\u003d\"-c:a copy\"\n      fi\n      OUTFILE\u003d\"$OUTDIR/${BASENAME}_Kesit_${CODEC_TAG}${BIT_TAG}_CRF${CRF_VAL}.mp4\"\n      echo \"\"\n      echo \"--- Kesilip ${CODEC_TAG}${BIT_TAG} CRF ${CRF_VAL} (${PRESET} | ses copy) yapiliyor... ---\"\n      run_ff -y \"${SEEK_REENC[@]}\" -i \"$INPUT\" $FPS_ARG $VF_ARG -sn -dn -c:v \"$VCODEC_OUT\" -preset \"$PRESET\" -crf \"$CRF_VAL\" -pix_fmt \"$PIX_OUT\" \"${CRF_ARGS[@]}\" $AUDIO_ARGS -movflags +faststart \"$OUTFILE\"\n      STATUS\u003d$?\n      ;;\n    4)\n      ask_vcodec\n      ask_fps_and_scale orig\n      ask_preset fast\n      if [ \"$VCODEC_OUT\" \u003d \"libx265\" ]; then\n        CRF_ARGS\u003d(-tag:v hvc1 -x265-params \"log-level\u003dwarning\")\n      else\n        CRF_ARGS\u003d()\n      fi\n      if [ -z \"$ACODEC\" ]; then\n        AUDIO_ARGS\u003d\"-an\"\n        OUTFILE\u003d\"$OUTDIR/${BASENAME}_Kesit_${CODEC_TAG}${BIT_TAG}_CRF${CRF_VAL}_Sessiz.mp4\"\n      else\n        ask_audio_bitrate 192\n        AUDIO_ARGS\u003d\"-c:a aac -b:a ${AB_VAL}k\"\n        OUTFILE\u003d\"$OUTDIR/${BASENAME}_Kesit_${CODEC_TAG}${BIT_TAG}_CRF${CRF_VAL}_AAC_${AB_VAL}k.mp4\"\n      fi\n      echo \"\"\n      echo \"--- Kesilip ${CODEC_TAG}${BIT_TAG} CRF ${CRF_VAL} (${PRESET}) + AAC yapiliyor... ---\"\n      run_ff -y \"${SEEK_REENC[@]}\" -i \"$INPUT\" $FPS_ARG $VF_ARG -sn -dn -c:v \"$VCODEC_OUT\" -preset \"$PRESET\" -crf \"$CRF_VAL\" -pix_fmt \"$PIX_OUT\" \"${CRF_ARGS[@]}\" $AUDIO_ARGS -movflags +faststart \"$OUTFILE\"\n      STATUS\u003d$?\n      ;;\n    *)\n      echo \"Gecersiz secim!\"\n      read -p \"Cikmak icin Enter...\"\n      exit 1\n      ;;\n  esac\n}\n\ncase \"$CHOICE\" in\n  1)\n    run_two_pass 20\n    ;;\n  2)\n    run_two_pass 100\n    ;;\n  3)\n    read -p \"Kac MB olsun? (Orn: 1, 8, 25): \" CUSTOM_MB\n    CUSTOM_MB\u003d\"${CUSTOM_MB/,/.}\"\n    if ! [[ \"$CUSTOM_MB\" \u003d~ ^[0-9]+(\\.[0-9]+)?$ ]] || [ \"$(awk -v m\u003d\"$CUSTOM_MB\" \u0027BEGIN { print (m \u003e 0) }\u0027)\" !\u003d \"1\" ]; then\n      echo \"Gecersiz boyut girdiniz!\"\n      read -p \"Cikmak icin Enter...\"\n      exit 1\n    fi\n    run_two_pass \"$CUSTOM_MB\"\n    ;;\n  4)\n    run_trim\n    ;;\n  5)\n    OUTFILE\u003d\"$OUTDIR/${BASENAME}_Remux.mp4\"\n    echo \"\"\n    echo \"--- Sadece kutu / format yenileniyor (-c copy)... ---\"\n    run_ff -y -i \"$INPUT\" -sn -dn -c copy -movflags +faststart \"$OUTFILE\"\n    STATUS\u003d$?\n    ;;\n  6)\n    if [ -z \"$ACODEC\" ]; then\n      echo \"Bu videoda ses izi bulunamadi!\"\n      read -p \"Cikmak icin Enter...\"\n      exit 1\n    fi\n    ask_audio_bitrate 256\n    OUTFILE\u003d\"$OUTDIR/${BASENAME}_AAC_${AB_VAL}k.mp4\"\n    echo \"\"\n    echo \"--- Goruntu kopyalanip ses ${AB_VAL}k AAC yapiliyor... ---\"\n    run_ff -y -i \"$INPUT\" -sn -dn -c:v copy -c:a aac -b:a \"${AB_VAL}k\" -movflags +faststart \"$OUTFILE\"\n    STATUS\u003d$?\n    ;;\n  7)\n    ask_vcodec\n    ask_preset fast\n    OUTFILE\u003d\"$OUTDIR/${BASENAME}_${CODEC_TAG}${BIT_TAG}_CRF${CRF_VAL}.mp4\"\n    if [ -z \"$ACODEC\" ]; then\n      AUDIO_ARGS\u003d\"-an\"\n    else\n      AUDIO_ARGS\u003d\"-c:a copy\"\n    fi\n    if [ \"$VCODEC_OUT\" \u003d \"libx265\" ]; then\n      CRF_ARGS\u003d(-tag:v hvc1 -x265-params \"log-level\u003dwarning\")\n    else\n      CRF_ARGS\u003d()\n    fi\n    echo \"\"\n    echo \"--- Goruntu ${CODEC_TAG}${BIT_TAG} CRF ${CRF_VAL} (${PRESET} | ses copy)... ---\"\n    run_ff -y -i \"$INPUT\" $EVEN_VF -sn -dn -c:v \"$VCODEC_OUT\" -preset \"$PRESET\" -crf \"$CRF_VAL\" -pix_fmt \"$PIX_OUT\" \"${CRF_ARGS[@]}\" $AUDIO_ARGS -movflags +faststart \"$OUTFILE\"\n    STATUS\u003d$?\n    if [ \"$STATUS\" -ne 0 ]; then\n      echo \"Ipucu: Ses kodegi MP4 kutusuna uymuyorsa 8. secenegi kullanin.\"\n    fi\n    ;;\n  8)\n    ask_vcodec\n    ask_preset fast\n    if [ \"$VCODEC_OUT\" \u003d \"libx265\" ]; then\n      CRF_ARGS\u003d(-tag:v hvc1 -x265-params \"log-level\u003dwarning\")\n    else\n      CRF_ARGS\u003d()\n    fi\n    if [ -z \"$ACODEC\" ]; then\n      AUDIO_ARGS\u003d\"-an\"\n      OUTFILE\u003d\"$OUTDIR/${BASENAME}_${CODEC_TAG}${BIT_TAG}_CRF${CRF_VAL}_Sessiz.mp4\"\n      echo \"\"\n      echo \"--- Videoda ses yok, ${CODEC_TAG}${BIT_TAG} CRF ${CRF_VAL} (${PRESET})... ---\"\n    else\n      ask_audio_bitrate 256\n      AUDIO_ARGS\u003d\"-c:a aac -b:a ${AB_VAL}k\"\n      OUTFILE\u003d\"$OUTDIR/${BASENAME}_${CODEC_TAG}${BIT_TAG}_CRF${CRF_VAL}_AAC_${AB_VAL}k.mp4\"\n      echo \"\"\n      echo \"--- ${CODEC_TAG}${BIT_TAG} CRF ${CRF_VAL} (${PRESET}) + Ses ${AB_VAL}k AAC... ---\"\n    fi\n    run_ff -y -i \"$INPUT\" $EVEN_VF -sn -dn -c:v \"$VCODEC_OUT\" -preset \"$PRESET\" -crf \"$CRF_VAL\" -pix_fmt \"$PIX_OUT\" \"${CRF_ARGS[@]}\" $AUDIO_ARGS -movflags +faststart \"$OUTFILE\"\n    STATUS\u003d$?\n    ;;\n  9)\n    if [ -z \"$ACODEC\" ]; then\n      echo \"Bu videoda ses izi bulunamadi!\"\n      read -p \"Cikmak icin Enter...\"\n      exit 1\n    fi\n    [ \"$ACODEC\" \u003d \"aac\" ] \u0026\u0026 AAC_ST\u003d\"Kayipsiz\" || AAC_ST\u003d\"Kayipli\"\n    [ \"$ACODEC\" \u003d \"mp3\" ] \u0026\u0026 MP3_ST\u003d\"Kayipsiz\" || MP3_ST\u003d\"Kayipli\"\n    echo \"\"\n    echo \"  Enter) Orijinal ($ACODEC) - Kayipsiz\"\n    echo \"  2) AAC (.m4a) - $AAC_ST\"\n    echo \"  3) MP3 (.mp3) - $MP3_ST\"\n    read -p \"Secim: \" AF_OPT\n    case \"$AF_OPT\" in\n      2|aac|AAC|m4a|M4A)\n        if [ \"$ACODEC\" \u003d \"aac\" ]; then\n          OUTFILE\u003d\"$OUTDIR/${BASENAME}_Ses.m4a\"\n          echo \"\"\n          echo \"--- Ses zaten AAC! %100 kayipsiz kopyalaniyor... ---\"\n          run_ff -y -i \"$INPUT\" -vn -sn -dn -c:a copy \"$OUTFILE\"\n        else\n          ask_audio_bitrate 256\n          OUTFILE\u003d\"$OUTDIR/${BASENAME}_Ses_${AB_VAL}k.m4a\"\n          echo \"\"\n          echo \"--- Ses ${AB_VAL}k AAC olarak cikariliyor... ---\"\n          run_ff -y -i \"$INPUT\" -vn -sn -dn -c:a aac -b:a \"${AB_VAL}k\" \"$OUTFILE\"\n        fi\n        STATUS\u003d$?\n        ;;\n      3|mp3|MP3)\n        if [ \"$ACODEC\" \u003d \"mp3\" ]; then\n          OUTFILE\u003d\"$OUTDIR/${BASENAME}_Ses.mp3\"\n          echo \"\"\n          echo \"--- Ses zaten MP3! %100 kayipsiz kopyalaniyor... ---\"\n          run_ff -y -i \"$INPUT\" -vn -sn -dn -c:a copy \"$OUTFILE\"\n        else\n          ask_audio_bitrate 256\n          OUTFILE\u003d\"$OUTDIR/${BASENAME}_Ses_${AB_VAL}k.mp3\"\n          echo \"\"\n          echo \"--- Ses ${AB_VAL}k MP3 olarak cikariliyor... ---\"\n          run_ff -y -i \"$INPUT\" -vn -sn -dn -c:a libmp3lame -b:a \"${AB_VAL}k\" \"$OUTFILE\"\n        fi\n        STATUS\u003d$?\n        ;;\n      *)\n        case \"$ACODEC\" in\n          aac) EXT\u003d\"m4a\" ;;\n          opus) EXT\u003d\"opus\" ;;\n          mp3) EXT\u003d\"mp3\" ;;\n          vorbis) EXT\u003d\"ogg\" ;;\n          flac) EXT\u003d\"flac\" ;;\n          ac3) EXT\u003d\"ac3\" ;;\n          eac3) EXT\u003d\"eac3\" ;;\n          alac) EXT\u003d\"m4a\" ;;\n          pcm_*) EXT\u003d\"wav\" ;;\n          *) EXT\u003d\"mka\" ;;\n        esac\n        OUTFILE\u003d\"$OUTDIR/${BASENAME}_Orijinal.${EXT}\"\n        echo \"\"\n        echo \"--- Orijinal ses (%100 kayipsiz: $ACODEC -\u003e .$EXT)... ---\"\n        run_ff -y -i \"$INPUT\" -vn -sn -dn -c:a copy \"$OUTFILE\"\n        STATUS\u003d$?\n        ;;\n    esac\n    ;;\n  10)\n    PASSDIR\u003d$(mktemp -d)\n    ln -s \"$INPUT\" \"$PASSDIR/$FILENAME\"\n    EXT_IN\u003d\"${FILENAME##*.}\"\n    if [ \"$EXT_IN\" !\u003d \"$FILENAME\" ] \u0026\u0026 [ -n \"$EXT_IN\" ] \u0026\u0026 [ \"$FILENAME\" !\u003d \"input.${EXT_IN}\" ]; then\n      ln -s \"$INPUT\" \"$PASSDIR/input.${EXT_IN}\"\n    fi\n    IN\u003d\"$INPUT\"\n    echo \"\"\n    echo \"Tam FFmpeg komutunu tek satirda yapistirin.\"\n    echo \"Girdi kisayollari: \\\"\\$IN\\\" | \\\"$FILENAME\\\" | input.${EXT_IN}\"\n    echo \"(cikti.mp4 yazarsaniz Movies/TermuxVideo\u0027ya gider)\"\n    echo \"\"\n    read -r -p \"Komut: \" RAW_CMD\n    if [ -z \"$RAW_CMD\" ]; then\n      echo \"Komut girilmedi, iptal edildi.\"\n      read -p \"Cikmak icin Enter...\"\n      exit 1\n    fi\n    echo \"\"\n    ( cd \"$PASSDIR\" \u0026\u0026 eval \"$RAW_CMD\" )\n    STATUS\u003d$?\n    if [ \"$STATUS\" -eq 0 ]; then\n      rm -f \"$PASSDIR\"/*.log \"$PASSDIR\"/*.log.temp \"$PASSDIR\"/*.cutree \"$PASSDIR\"/*.mbtree \"$PASSDIR\"/ffmpeg2pass* 2\u003e/dev/null\n      for f in \"$PASSDIR\"/*; do\n        if [ -f \"$f\" ] \u0026\u0026 [ ! -L \"$f\" ]; then\n          mv -f \"$f\" \"$OUTDIR/\" \u0026\u0026 OUTFILE\u003d\"$OUTDIR/$(basename -- \"$f\")\"\n        fi\n      done\n    fi\n    ;;\n  *)\n    echo \"Gecersiz secim!\"\n    read -p \"Cikmak icin Enter...\"\n    exit 1\n    ;;\nesac\n\necho \"\"\nif [ \"${STATUS:-1}\" -eq 0 ]; then\n  if [ -n \"$OUTFILE\" ] \u0026\u0026 [ -f \"$OUTFILE\" ]; then\n    SIZE_HR\u003d$(du -h \"$OUTFILE\" | cut -f1)\n    echo \"BASARILI! Cikti Boyutu: $SIZE_HR\"\n    echo \"Konum: $OUTFILE\"\n    command -v termux-media-scan \u003e/dev/null \u0026\u0026 timeout 5 termux-media-scan \"$OUTFILE\" \u003e/dev/null 2\u003e\u00261\n  else\n    echo \"BASARILI! Komut tamamlandi.\"\n  fi\n  case \"$INPUT\" in\n    \"$HOME/downloads/\"*) rm -f \"$INPUT\" ;;\n  esac\nelse\n  echo \"Hata olustu!\"\nfi\n\necho \"\"\nread -p \"Kapatmak icin Enter\u0027a basin...\"\nEOF\nchmod +x ~/bin/termux-file-editor \u0026\u0026 bash -n ~/bin/termux-file-editor \u0026\u0026 echo \"KURULUM TAMAM!\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## 5. Kullanım ve Bakım Özeti\n\n* **Standart Kullanım:** Galeri veya dosya yöneticisi $\\rightarrow$ **Paylaş $\\rightarrow$ Termux $\\rightarrow$ `Edit`**.\n* **5–15 GB Dev Filmlerde Sıfır Kopyalama ile Çalıştırma:** Paylaş menüsü dosyayı geçici olarak `~/downloads/`\u0027a kopyalar. Boş alan kısıtlıysa doğrudan Termux içinden diskteki dosya yoluyla çalıştırılabilir (orijinal dosyaya kesinlikle dokunulmaz):\n  ```bash\n  ~/bin/termux-file-editor \"/sdcard/Download/Film.mkv\"\n  ```\n* **İsteğe Bağlı Manuel Önbellek Temizliği:**\n  ```bash\n  du -sh ~/downloads \"$TMPDIR\" \u0026\u0026 rm -rf ~/downloads/* \"$TMPDIR\"/tmp.* \u0026\u0026 pkg clean\n  ```",
